{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e17f936186f9ecfc2a3ed5fc2776997952aee705eaf1b2936d431b2164f12a57", "ja": "（BRIGHT DIAMONDと名付けられたチーム\nの南エリアツアーが、いよいよ最終公演を迎える！）", "zh": "（名为BRIGHT DIAMOND的团队南部地区巡演，终于迎来了最终公演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1001_president", "source_sha256": "3609d968489a4cdb13c27d83cc8a563edff2ef2a9dcf7b559ad436bdcec2efda", "ja": "BRIGHT DIAMONDのツアー集大成ライブ、\nリハーサルを見せてもらったが……。", "zh": "看了BRIGHT DIAMOND巡演的集大成演唱会彩排，\n然而……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1002_president", "source_sha256": "496a08975546eb056f839e12ede495c81eed103ae6208101be2b545e8f844229", "ja": "実に！　実に、素晴らしいパフォーマンスだった！\nこれは本番に、より一層期待がかかるというものだね！", "zh": "太精彩了！表演真是太出色了！\n这让人对正式演出更加期待了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d211f7b207ecf3e3a62d744b0d79cbeb686db5c3087005ebac9aba34c30ca2a5", "ja": "はい！　みんなが南エリアのツアーで培ってきたものを\nこの最終公演で、思いきり発揮してもらうつもりです！", "zh": "是的！我打算让大家在这场最终公演中，尽情展现大家通过南部地区巡演积累下来的成果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1004_101kot", "source_sha256": "9df8a781396e23b1ee814665edb868ec3c64c4c47acae91d84b99456f2ddb546", "ja": "みんな、本当にダイヤモンドみたいに\nキラキラしていて……とっても素敵でした♪", "zh": "大家真的都像钻石一样闪闪发光……实在是太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bb73554a20628ea36fe74c013943063151d07397d6ebe0854ef881e7bfd68f28", "ja": "社長と音無さんにリハを見てもらえて、\nみんなも気合いが入ったと思いますよ！", "zh": "社长和音无小姐来看了彩排，我觉得大家也都打起精神来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "99cdd291ff3f23576d195d9eb120d5de01e36e32818c1738a834bc0a02a532af", "ja": "そういえば、青羽さんも席の後ろのほうで\n見てくれていたんですけど……どこに行ったのかな。", "zh": "说起来，青羽小姐也在后排看着呢……她去哪儿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1007_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "a2ac2ac3af1a5b84cc90342598605f1e4e89254cb5ef4e0ec383a5c4be8d3306", "ja": "気持ち～！　飛んでいけ～！\nえ～い！　え～～～いっ！", "zh": "心情～飞走吧～！\n喝～！喝～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "f32082d624a4646355ed027c4d9f223aad0d74990adefdd84a5ce14431c5715d", "ja": "み、美咲ちゃん？\n何か、悪い虫でもいるのかしら……？", "zh": "美、美咲？\n是有什么害虫吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "82e228552c2078d08d02098356a5182a3662bc0363cd84cb990024f47040c69f", "ja": "窓を開けたほうがいいかもしれませんね。", "zh": "也许还是把窗户打开比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "629efbcb4b794955237113cebe8a62ee6d1a56371e168d2b54536c6956015023", "ja": "えっ？　……ああっ！？　社長さん、\n音無先輩……{$P$}さんまで！", "zh": "咦？……啊！？社长先生、音无前辈……连{$P$}先生也来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "2356a77f0762d69a15a31fff3d3870c4e84434e80afc109621d99a8aa2b48630", "ja": "い、いえ！　これは何でもないんですっ！", "zh": "没、没什么！这个什么事都没有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "28d1d92552acc87f77b5a1dbc0e1e7ac83228264d1a89aef33655c8358842357", "ja": "そうかね？　なら良かった。\nまだ暑いからね、虫も元気なんだろう。", "zh": "是吗？那就好。\n天气还很热，虫子也很有精神吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "5ac5406ae1a7c5ba27dfc03903ccae4e0b1b57e348fda67f69f57b7f737a7fad", "ja": "しかし今回の南エリア公演は、青羽くんの地元……\n君も、参加したかったんじゃないかね？", "zh": "不过这次的南部地区公演可是青羽的家乡……你应该也想参加吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "95adff31af24cf15ba98298dc43233ccd6227c09878589b213362e93307571e6", "ja": "そうですね。私も、{$P$}さんや\nみんなと一緒に、行けたらよかったんですけど……。", "zh": "是啊。要是能和{$P$}先生以及大家一起去就好了，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "a080e451bc4349f204bca00f8dc331874018f24e875b2bb6d71c6926ba48b254", "ja": "でも、みんなが地方公演をしている間も、\n劇場は劇場でがんばらないとですから！", "zh": "不过，大家去外地公演期间，剧场这边也得努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "86d8769234c860464abb0918a99f4776604f7fd53caca60b6a59ecc9a2e87a7b", "ja": "そうね。地方公演で増えたお客さんが、劇場に\n興味を持って観にきてくれるかもしれない……。", "zh": "是啊。说不定地方公演增加的观众，会对剧场产生兴趣，前来看演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "ce767e957ef12bce8316add4db42bf3aa38c507c8355953e5487461d90f402d4", "ja": "そう思ったら、休んでいるヒマなんてありません！\n新しいファンを、ひとりも逃さないようにしなくちゃ！", "zh": "一想到这里，就没有时间休息了！\n一定要一个不漏地留住新粉丝才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "52caec182b58c218409bd70a255fc89cfb49bcb97f7006bf1626734c831e002e", "ja": "ふたりとも、素晴らしい心意気だ！\nこれは我々も、負けてはいられないね。", "zh": "两个人都是令人钦佩的气魄！\n我们也不能输给她们啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3b23d3f98ac76b756c9a2eabe4f0d1f8a14a704e44bccfa70bbdb5b3b8aca6ec", "ja": "そうですね。地方公演の成果を\n劇場に持って帰れるよう、頑張ります！", "zh": "是啊。为了把地方公演的成果带回剧场，我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1022_102mis", "source_sha256": "5220c1b30ec145e16fd43769e3e0bfb1a57c525cd1849939109fa5f7007d4c4e", "ja": "はいっ！　私は劇場にいるみんなと、\nしっかり留守を守っておきます！", "zh": "好的！我会和剧场里的大家一起，好好守住这里的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "95c996dad077efd745733a8a945ba3f1cd6d9c9c66694487cd4d3818648445c2", "ja": "そして私と社長は、事務所を……\n最終公演のお土産話、楽しみにしてますね♪", "zh": "还有我和社长，会好好守住办公室的……\n我很期待你们带回最终公演的趣闻哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "977a38ce0c6d390a30ca67ede8f53ffa6f20cd22841521642d97ee713c3fb95d", "ja": "うむ。BRIGHT DIAMONDの集大成ライブ\n成功は、君の肩にかかっている。頼んだよ！", "zh": "嗯。BRIGHT DIAMOND集大成演唱会的\n成功，就全看你的了。拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "54c64ad78773453828667fe51782894d6b14eb7c05b65337f5fa3f7b01328ae6", "ja": "はい！　全力を尽くして、\n最高のフィナーレを飾ります！", "zh": "好的！我会竭尽全力，为这场演出画上最精彩的句号！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
